{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/2013032/block/singleImage/3269142/df/01M7JZHVCNN4CB3T2Y2G0X38F2.jpg?updatedAt=1794859804\"/><figcaption>中港城 車尾箱聖誕市集回歸 逾百品牌進駐海旁</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/2013032/block/singleImage/3269144/df/01M7JZJ3XNYHDV5EE1NR76HHY3.jpg?updatedAt=1794859804\"/><figcaption>中港城 車尾箱聖誕市集回歸 逾百品牌進駐海旁</figcaption></figure><p>近年市集文化盛行，集潮流選物、特色美食及生活品味於一身的主題市集深受歡迎。中港城今年再度聯乘本地街頭木藝品牌Start from Zero舉辦「中港城車尾箱聖誕市集」，並首度擴展至商場室內及戶外空間同步舉行，匯聚逾100個本地及海外品牌，包括Treble Coffee、FAT COFFEE WITH、LILABOC及FUJIFILM等，同場亦有TEEMTONEfai甜筒暉、Curry Boy等人氣美食進駐。 此外，現場設有逾6米高港式霓虹聖誕樹、木藝遊戲及戶外音樂表演，並歡迎市民攜同愛寵參與。收益更將撥捐關注流浪動物的非牟利機構，為節日增添意義。中港城車尾箱聖誕市集將於12月11日至13日、19日至20日及24日至27日舉行，為維港海旁注入濃厚節日氣氛。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T21:43:45.562395+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":377,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T20:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T13:48:12.656064+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T21:37:05.858253+00:00","content_hash":"2aa86e3e5c2fbadbea8878074a512a86fce3c727771933151855d6dbee690091","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T21:43:45.562395+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}